25.746" end="00:26.353">And </span><span begin="00:26.353" end="00:27.354">I </span><span begin="00:27.354" end="00:28.114">got </span><span begin="00:28.114" end="00:28.512">swept </span><span begin="00:28.512" end="00:32.397">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.006" end="00:38.356"><span begin="00:33.006" end="00:33.506">I </span><span begin="00:33.506" end="00:34.160">didn't </span><span begin="00:34.160" end="00:34.818">know </span><span begin="00:34.818" end="00:35.881">that </span><span begin="00:35.881" end="00:36.086">it </span><span begin="00:36.086" end="00:36.644">was </span><span begin="00:36.644" end="00:37.046">so </span><span begin="00:37.046" end="00:38.354">cold-And</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.058" end="00:43.253"><span begin="00:38.058" end="00:38.556">You </span><span begin="00:38.556" end="00:39.014">needed </span><span begin="00:39.014" end="00:40.122">someone </span><span begin="00:40.122" end="00:40.374">to </span><span begin="00:40.374" end="00:40.729">show </span><span begin="00:40.729" end="00:40.930">you </span><span begin="00:40.930" end="00:41.329">the </span><span begin="00:41.329" end="00:43.247">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.953" end="00:47.241"><span begin="00:42.953" end="00:43.458">So </span><span begin="00:43.458" end="00:43.660">I </span><span begin="00:43.660" end="00:43.859">took </span><span begin="00:43.859" end="00:44.114">your </span><span begin="00:44.114" end="00:44.769">hand </span><span begin="00:44.769" end="00:45.825">and </span><span begin="00:45.825" end="00:46.029">we </span><span begin="00:46.029" end="00:46.735">figured </span><span begin="00:46.735" end="00:47.234">out-That</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.941" end="00:56.217"><span begin="00:46.941" end="00:48.753">When </span><span begin="00:48.753" end="00:49.312">the </span><span begin="00:49.312" end="00:50.065">tide </span><span begin="00:50.065" end="00:50.319">comes </span><span begin="00:50.319" end="00:50.5